FLOOR 3 of 9 - THE LIBRARIAN'S LEDGER

The village keeps a ledger of 500 villagers in ledger.csv.
Every villager has a secret word written in the last column.

You are looking for the villager called Orin who lives in Mossfield.
Careful: there are many Orins, and Mossfield is a big village.

Orin's secret word is the password for locstd03.
Print only that word, not the whole row.
